  "title": "On the table",
  "goal": "Say where things are with üst, alt, ön, arka, yan and iç: masanın üstünde, yatağın altında.",
  "points": ["gp-place-nouns"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Turkish says **on**, **under** and **behind** with nouns: *üst* (top), *alt* (bottom), *ön* (front), *arka* (back), *yan* (side), *iç* (inside). Put the reference in the genitive, then add a possessive, n and a case: *masanın üstünde* (on the table), *evin önüne* (to the front of the house).",
    "see": "gp-place-nouns"
  },
